    {
      "description": "You'll get python-powered xonsh shell with portable python and pip on the host without any system installations on the host. You can install PyPi packages manually or bring them with you automatically by using xxh-plugin-prerun-dotfiles. Also, don't forget about xxh-plugins like zoxide.",
      "items": [],
      "title": "Way 1. Using xonsh"
    },
    {
